abstract: "Two complete Lean formalizations on arbitrary complete real inner-product spaces: the unique weighted Hilbert–Schmidt least-change secant perturbation and its DFP specialization under the supplied invertible-factor hypothesis. Includes exact audits, source pins, predecessor credit, reproducible evidence and rejecting controls. Substantial Codex assistance; no novelty or human peer-review claim."
